comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T22:46:21.479Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus of 2637 items with body and no truncation searched for Greptile and 3.5.0. Prior pm-obmgi3 is completed 3.4.1 work and is preserved. Open and in-progress inventories were read before creation; no 3.5.0 owner exists. Registry engines >=22.0.0 fit the supported runtime and publication is older than the pnpm 11 default 24-hour release-age window."
  "2026-09-04T22:47:40.206Z","harness:codex","Installed Greptile 3.5.0 with normal pnpm install: no release-age exclusions, engine overrides, build permissions or runtime-floor changes. Incompatible majors remain canonical open work: TypeScript 7 under pm-do5b (typescript-eslint 8.69 peer <6.1), Vitest/coverage 5 under pm-fokyhh (@codspeed/vitest-plugin 5.7.1 peer Vitest 3/4), and npm-package-arg 14 under pm-ksr40d (requires Node >=22.22.2 while pm supports >=22.18). No duplicate migration items created and those deferred items are not claimed."
  "2026-09-04T22:58:33.203Z","harness:codex","Final consolidated review-fix proof: 8404 tests / 605 files with exact statements 62140/62140, branches 47102/47102, functions 12903/12903, lines 59778/59778. Full static quality, typecheck and linked tests passed. Fresh temporary-directory recovery and packed npm/npx/bunx smoke passed. The independent eight-process identity race accepted one writer and refused seven. Dependency audit reports zero vulnerabilities. Hosted new-head checks, renewed bot review and merged-main operational proof remain separate required delivery gates."
  "2026-09-04T23:08:28.701Z","harness:codex","Hosted static at 70d719899 failed with missing_escape_class and missing_gate_evidence on this chore. Exact code inspection shows isDefectItem classifies Issue or tags bug/defect/security; recurs_from was not the trigger. This was a routine development-tool minor upgrade with zero known vulnerabilities, not a security-defect remediation. Remove the mistakenly broad security tag, retain dependencies and review-tooling plus existing typed lineage, and preserve the original classification in immutable history. Do not fabricate a scanner finding or weaken the gate. The full static pass was before closure, so the final terminal-state evidence gate must also be checked after close."
  "2026-09-04T23:08:38.357Z","harness:codex","After terminal closure, the unchanged defect-evidence gate now passes all 122 governed terminal defects with zero findings. Its --negative-control still exits 1 and diagnoses the intentionally incomplete pm-negative-control item, proving the gate remains effective. Classification correction, not a waiver or policy change."
